{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And if even these.</b> As Rashi explained: and if on account of these, like 'skin for skin' — עור בעד עור — and HaShem will shut up on his behalf — ויסגור ה׳ בעדו." "<b>And I will add to discipline you.</b> I shall add to discipline you with seven further plagues, as in ויסף חמישתו עליו." "<b>Seven.</b> On account of the sabbatical year that you did not observe in it, and the matter proves it: 'then the land shall satisfy its sabbaths' — אז תרצה הארץ את שבתותיה." "<b>On account of your sins.</b> Because of your sins, as in כי עליך הורגנו כל היום. כי עליך נשאתי חרפה."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {0 "The abbreviation שפירש״י is resolved as 'as Rashi explained'; the final quoted phrase is from Job, here applied to the verse under discussion.", 1 "The comparison is to Genesis 5:3, where 'ויסף' likewise means 'added further.'"}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:15:36.319077130Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}